OL,3,GNEWSAPolice unit pulls plug on Palantir
OL,4,AAI technology
OL,5,
OL,6,FA regional policing unit dedicated to
OL,7,Ftackling serious and organised crime
OL,8,Fhas decided not to continue using
OL,9,Fsoftware from the controversial US tech
OL,10,Fgiant Palantir after a two-year trial.
OL,12,FThe US firm's technology, which allows
OL,13,Flarge data sets to be analysed and
OL,14,Fsearched easily, including through the
OL,15,Fuse of AI, is being used by militaries
OL,16,Fand public services across the world.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
