OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice unit pulls plug on Palantir
OL,4,AAI technology
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Midlands Special Operations Unit
OL,7,F(Emsou) said it started a trial in
OL,8,FOctober 2024 to see how well Palantir's
OL,9,Fsoftware could help it investigate
OL,10,Fcrime without compromising ethics or
OL,11,Faccountability.
OL,13,FBut it has decided not to fund a new
OL,14,Fcontract and told the BBC that Palantir
OL,15,Fwill now have to demonstrate it has cut
OL,16,Fall links with the force's systems and
OL,17,Fhas deleted all of its data.
